          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert and oriented to person and place, not exact date. Speech fluent; cranial nerves grossly intact. Power 4+/5 in left arm (old finding), 5/5 elsewhere. Gait not fully assessed; transfers with 4-wheel walker and one-person assist, slow and stable. No new focal signs."
      }
    },
    {
